' status: Preparatory catalog/admission integration IMPLEMENTED and VERIFIED; baseline full-app lint exception recorded in _spec/_plans/PLAN-ml-adjutant.md.
' related: _spec/packages/starchess-core/adjutant-definitions.puml
' related: _spec/apps/starchess/wireframe.puml
' related: _spec/apps/starchess/core/adjutant/cc-focus.puml
